# 25 — Watermarks: Out-of-order event handling with 5s tolerance
# Events arrive slightly out of order but within tolerance

@0s SensorEvent { value: 10.0 }
@3s SensorEvent { value: 20.0 }
@1s SensorEvent { value: 15.0 }
@5s SensorEvent { value: 25.0 }
@4s SensorEvent { value: 22.0 }
@8s SensorEvent { value: 30.0 }
